ir 400mg TDS till delivery + Erythromycin, steroid + </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SVD</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16148]\" style=\"padding-left: 108pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt;34 steroid + Erythromycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+IOL</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16149]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Herpes</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16150]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> before 34 weeks:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16151]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MDT discussion regarding MOD:</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16152]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 108pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Expectant management</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16153]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 63pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> I/V acyclovir </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+ </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Erythromycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>+ steroid </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> c/s ac</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>cording</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> to MDT</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> decision</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16154]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 108pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Immediate birth \u2013 C/S.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16155]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>After 34 weeks, steroid + C/S.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16156]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>HIV + herpes:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>suppressive doses from 32 weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16157]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Urinary retention =&gt; </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>catheterize</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> the patient </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16158]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>15% =&gt; unknown either P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> or recurrent for confirmation PCR is recommended but not in primary.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16159]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>FSE, FBS, instrument can be applied in Recurrent.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" 